  "details": "1. Open VRChat.\n\n2. Update your status via API\n\n3. Witness a chance for the status display to not update on your end, or other clients.\n\nNote: This is also a problem with setting the status in game, it can take a while to reflect what you changed for others.\n\nExtra sidenote information: I made a little tool to take my plex playing status and set it up to update my VRChat status, this is intended for streaming my own media and letting people know what I'm watching before they even join me, but frequently that status doesn't update for people, making the status feature quite frustrating.",
